00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.999
That's how we're kicking off today's
stream.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.999
First, PLLI...

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:11.999
Let's start with a round of applause.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.999
Let me sit down and get started.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.999
Ja, thanks so much for waiting.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.999
Today isn't actually...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.999
November 1, but let's go back

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.999
to November 1 and celebrate my birthday

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.999
one more time with all of you,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.999
PLLI. Ja, to start off,

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.999
I picked “Replay.”

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.999
I spent a long time deciding what to sing.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.999
Thinking back on my previous birthday
streams,

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.999
I figured that sooner or later

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.999
people would watch this one again, too,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.999
including anyone who couldn't make it
today.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.999
So why not start a replay

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.999
with “Replay”?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.999
The title caught my eye, and when I
listened,

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.999
the lyrics sounded so heartfelt.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.999
It made me think PLLI couldn't let me go.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.999
And I can't let you go either.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.999
That's what I was thinking

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.999
when I sang my heart out for you.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.999
Thank you for all the birthday wishes.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.999
You can just declare

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.999
November Hamin's month.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.999
One thing's a bit different today: my
wisdom tooth...

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.999
I had it taken out, so my speech

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.999
might not be as clear as usual.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.999
Thanks for bearing with me.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.999
Ah, congratulations! Thank you!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.999
November is Hamin's month, everyone.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.999
Don't forget it!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.999
Let's get on with today's stream.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.999
It was my birthday during the concert.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.999
I celebrated in Macau,

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.999
and got birthday wishes from so many PLLI

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.999
and from the members, too.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.999
They really showered me with them.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.999
Some of you may have noticed,

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.999
and some may not have,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:09:00.999
but I got an unusual number of ending
poses.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.999
If you watch it back, you'll see

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.999
why they kept cutting to Hamin

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.999
at the end.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.999
After the concert,

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.999
I went live on Weverse

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.999
and spent some more time with you.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.999
We chatted about all sorts of things,

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.999
and I sang for you, too.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.999
You gave me such a warm response.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.999
So warm, it's still hot in here.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.999
It's like the heater's on.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.999
PLLI somehow keep me cool in summer

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.999
and warm me up in winter.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.999
That's your little bit of magic.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.999
Thank you! If you missed it,

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.999
fans posted a lot of Shorts,

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.999
and there's a full replay, too.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.999
Do check it out.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.999
Give it a replay,

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.999
please!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:49.999
I was reading the chat earlier

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.999
and saw a lot of you talking about the
ring.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.999
Is anyone wearing theirs right now?

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.999
It's my birthday ring.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.999
Some call it a first-birthday ring. Ja,
look here.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.999
You can adjust the size.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.999
It's cutting-edge technology!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.999
Adjust it to fit your finger,

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.999
or put it on a chain as a necklace.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.999
Or, um, hang it from your ear?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.999
Maybe not as an earring.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.999
Anyway, wear it

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:23.999
however suits you.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.999
You say it's pretty? Thank you!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.999
“No awkward pauses.”

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.999
No dead air here.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.999
You know who's hosting, right?

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.999
That's right. Me.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.999
Let me brag a little.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.999
You think the first-birthday ring is cute?

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.999
I don't know if you mean a baby's
first-birthday ring

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.999
or a ring that looks like a rock.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.999
Either way,

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.999
I'd love for lots of you to wear it

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.999
as a matching ring with me.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.999
We already have the same scent on our
clothes.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.999
Now we can wear the same ring, too.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.999
Isn't that nice? Going about our days

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:07.999
under the same sun, together.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.999
Hamin and PLLI, together.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.999
As time goes by,

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:15.999
you and I...

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.999
We'll smell the same.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.999
And we'll have the same ring.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.999
Nice. Let's match everything.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.999
What should we match next?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.999
I'm taking suggestions.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.999
I'll think it over,

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.999
and hopefully we'll get to match again.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.999
On Bubble

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.999
or on a stream, we can coordinate.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.999
It'd be fun to try more things

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.999
with the members

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.999
and with PLLI.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.999
Ja, on my birthday stream two years ago,

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.999
we played a game all about complimenting
Hamin.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.999
Do you remember?

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.999
You do, right? You have to remember.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.999
We did the compliment game. This year,

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.999
how about playing another game with PLLI?

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.999
Would you be up for that?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:07.999
What do you think?

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.999
I really enjoy playing games

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.999
with you, PLLI.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.999
So I put together a few things.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:16.999
Are you ready, everyone?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:21.999
If you're ready, let's go straight

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:22.999
to the game.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.999
Roll it!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.999
What? What's happening to my body?

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.999
Why do I look like this?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.999
Oh, it's that thing! Wait...

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.999
The computer's...

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.999
What is this? Help! Click something!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.999
Give me my body back!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:13:24.999
Huh?

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:30.999
Where am I? Who am I?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:35.999
I've been dumped in some strange place.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.999
What kind of game are we playing here?

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.999
Somebody tell me.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.999
Are we going

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.999
bungee jumping?

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.999
I'm inside the game!

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:54.999
Is this a test?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.999
Hello?

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.999
Who's there? Caligo?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.999
Oh, Caligo!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.999
Caligo, what's going on? Yes?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.999
Don't tell me...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.999
We're playing Tekken?

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.999
I've only ever played Tekken like this.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.999
But, ah, let's

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.999
give this a go.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:19.999
Come a little closer, please.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.999
We both need to be in frame. Right.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.999
Ja, let's pick

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.999
a character.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.999
Let's see who's available.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.999
There's quite a lineup. Ja, that yellow

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:32.999
outfit looks like Bruce Lee.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.999
Oh, and that taekwondo uniform

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.999
looks like a secret weapon. Plus,

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.999
I think I see trainee-era Hamin.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.999
The animal pajamas from recently, and over
there...

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.999
What's that? Oh, a spider.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.999
I'm curious about the question mark, but

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.999
I'll take the yellow outfit.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.999
Let's go with the Bruce Lee look.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.999
You're not picking one?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.999
Oh, there's only one for you?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.999
Got it.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:28.999
Let's go.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.999
[Game announcer] Round one!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.999
Whoa!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.999
Ah! Hey!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:44.999
Hah!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.999
Oh!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:16:07.999
A gun?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:24.999
Ah!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.999
Impressive.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.999
I think my throat just caught there.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.999
Oh my!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.999
We need to stay on camera this time,

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.999
so a little closer. Yes.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:40.999
I won't go easy this time.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.999
I'll switch characters.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:47.999
Let's see another character.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:48.999
I'll go with...

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:53.999
Taekwondo Hamin.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:17:10.999
Taekwondo Hamin, I choose you!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.999
Ah!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.999
[Brief indistinct exclamation]

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:20.999
How do you do the kihap? The shout?

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:25.999
You can't speak? Ah, okay.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.999
Are we ready, then?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.999
Let's go.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:18:02.999
On to round two!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:14.999
[Game announcer] Ready!

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:21.999
Hah!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:44.999
Ah!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:58.999
Okay.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.999
With this taekwondo uniform on,

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.999
Caligo's no match for me.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.999
Still want to take me on?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.999
Answer me.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.999
Step a little further in.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.999
Answer me.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.999
Fine. I acknowledge

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.999
your fighting spirit. For round three,

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.999
I'll fight you in a different outfit.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.999
I'll take you on

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:36.999
as trainee Hamin.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:20:07.999
Transform!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.999
Come on.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.999
Let's talk this out.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.999
Ja, stand here, please. Ja...

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:14.999
We're done fighting now.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.999
It's over, it's over. Ja, see

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.999
how the edge of the frame cuts you off?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.999
Don't go past it. Step further in. But...

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.999
You're a little shorter than I expected.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:24.999
A bit short... No, it's fine.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:25.999
It's fine. I'll do this.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.999
Let's sit down first

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.999
and have a little chat before we fight.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.999
Are you any good at a war of words?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.999
I can't hear you.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.999
Oh, you can talk!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.999
So Korean's okay? A little?

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.999
A little. — What language

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.999
do you usually speak?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.999
Oh, a bit of Caligo-speak. Ja,

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.999
as I was saying, look:

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.999
your shoulder's cut off in the shot.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.999
Just move in a little

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.999
and take a seat here. That's it.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:04.999
Ja.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.999
Could you start

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:07.999
by introducing yourself?

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.999
Hello, everyone.

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:10.999
I'm Caligo.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.999
Oh, Caligo! It's great

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:13.999
to meet you. Thanks for

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:18.999
making time for us. I've

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:19.999
heard a lot

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:20.999
about you.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.999
What have you heard?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.999
That you're a huge PLAVE fan.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:25.999
That's right.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.999
Do you know many

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:28.999
PLAVE songs?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.999
— All of them.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.999
You know them all? In that case,

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.999
do you have a favorite

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:36.999
PLAVE song?

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.999
Probably the one that just came out.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:39.999
“Star Trace.”

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.999
Oh, “Star Trace.”

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.999
Wow, “Star Trace.” Could you

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.999
show us a little bit of it?

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:47.999
I do have a favorite part.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.999
Oh, you do?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.999
You've come prepared.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:54.999
Oh! Let's see it properly,

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.999
right in the middle.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.999
Here?

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:04.999
Six, seven, eight!

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:05.999
Oh!

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:07.999
Wow!

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.999
When did you practice this?

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:10.999
I'm a huge fan, remember?

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:14.999
Oh, really? I heard you know

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.999
not just our dance tracks,

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.999
but the B-sides, too.

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:20.999
And my second favorite...

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:23.999
Could we hear a line of the first one
live?

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:24.999
— I'm not sure I can.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:27.999
As you can probably hear,

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:28.999
my voice is a little rough.

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:29.999
Oh, your throat's bothering you?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.999
I see. We'll skip the singing, then.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:33.999
Ja, let's get serious

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:35.999
about this match. We're playing

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.999
none other than Pikachu Volleyball.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.999
Feeling confident about Pikachu
Volleyball?

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:50.999
— I am. — Great! Cue Pikachu Volleyball!

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:53.999
Ja, time for Pikachu Volleyball.

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.999
I've heard that Caligo's good at it,

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:59.999
but I've never actually

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.999
played against him. So today,

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:04.999
I've got something to prove.

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:07.999
I'll show you once again

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:10.999
that I'm PLAVE's number one

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:14.999
Pikachu Volleyball player.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:15.999
No, that's not Park Jeongho.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.999
Don't get the wrong idea. This is Caligo.

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.999
Caligo himself.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.999
You're from Planet Caligo, right?

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:26.999
There's a little lag in those answers.

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.999
Ja, looks like we're ready.

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:29.999
You know the controls, right?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.999
I do.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.999
Okay. Got it.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:36.999
Ja, ja. No, it's not Noah either.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.999
Ja, it's not one of our members.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:44.999
Ja, let's go straight into round three.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.999
Take us to the Pikachu map.

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.999
Let's play fair and square.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:51.999
No holding back.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.999
Good luck!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.999
Okay.

00:23:56.000 --> 00:24:00.999
Oh, feeling nervous?

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:07.999
Pikachu!

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.999
Ja, I'll give you a head start.

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:12.999
That's how we'll begin.

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:16.999
I'll spot you three points. Surprised?

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.999
Oh, but... Okay, ja, that's three points

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:29.999
for you.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:39.999
That's it.

00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:43.999
That's it. Wait a second.

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:45.999
Have you been practicing?

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:52.999
What's going on?

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.999
I just need one point

00:24:55.000 --> 00:25:04.999
to turn things around.

00:25:05.000 --> 00:25:08.999
Oh, no!

00:25:09.000 --> 00:25:16.999
Hang on.

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:19.999
There we go. Now it's really starting.

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:20.999
Ja, everyone,

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:24.999
lend me your strength!

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:25.999
I'll show you how

00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:36.999
to make a comeback.

00:25:37.000 --> 00:25:42.999
That's it.

00:25:43.000 --> 00:26:06.999
[Exclaims]

00:26:07.000 --> 00:26:13.999
Oh, that's it.

00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:15.999
Ja, we're almost there.

00:26:16.000 --> 00:26:20.999
That's it.

00:26:21.000 --> 00:26:23.999
That's going in.

00:26:24.000 --> 00:26:25.999
Ja, with one point left,

00:26:26.000 --> 00:26:29.999
can I turn it around?

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:33.999
Almost there.

00:26:34.000 --> 00:26:35.999
Go in!

00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:40.999
Oh!

00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:56.999
Stay focused to the end.

00:26:57.000 --> 00:27:05.999
We're tied! We're tied!

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:11.999
Uh...

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:17.999
In! It's going in. That's it!

00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:22.999
What? How many points do I need?

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.999
That's it!

00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:33.999
Come on, it's got to drop now!

00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:45.999
Round three was no big deal either.

00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:48.999
And that makes

00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:51.999
the score two to one.

00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:53.999
Did that hurt?

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:56.999
You're shrinking back.

00:27:57.000 --> 00:27:58.999
Must've hurt.

00:27:59.000 --> 00:28:02.999
But we're not done yet.

00:28:03.000 --> 00:28:05.999
I'll go pick

00:28:06.000 --> 00:28:09.999
my next outfit.

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:11.999
I'll put on my cute

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:16.999
animal pajamas and see

00:28:17.000 --> 00:28:18.999
if I can beat Caligo.

00:28:19.000 --> 00:28:48.999
Transform!

00:28:49.000 --> 00:29:16.999
Let's go.

00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:19.999
Wait! You can't hit me.

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:23.999
Would you hit someone this cute? Look!

00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:25.999
Look at the chat. See?

00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:28.999
Anyway,

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:29.999
let me show you my attack.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:35.999
Try blocking it, okay?

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:44.999
[Performs a cute chant]

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:48.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:51.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:58.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:29:59.000 --> 00:30:02.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:30:03.000 --> 00:30:13.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:30:14.000 --> 00:30:16.999
What do you think of my attack?

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:20.999
Come closer. There's more where that came
from!

00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:24.999
I'm putting you under arrest!

00:30:25.000 --> 00:30:28.999
[Performs an arrest-themed dance]

00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:33.999
[Dance continues]

00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:38.999
[Dance continues]

00:30:39.000 --> 00:30:41.999
[Repeats the arrest chant]

00:30:42.000 --> 00:30:45.999
[Arrest chant continues]

00:30:46.000 --> 00:30:48.999
[Arrest chant continues]

00:30:49.000 --> 00:30:58.999
[Arrest chant continues]

00:30:59.000 --> 00:31:03.999
As expected, nobody can beat me.

00:31:04.000 --> 00:31:12.999
You're under arrest!

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:15.999
Ja, that was quite a beating.

00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:17.999
Is your stomach okay?

00:31:18.000 --> 00:31:18.999
I'm fine.

00:31:19.000 --> 00:31:19.999
Oh, okay.

00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:22.999
There's some stomach medicine over there.

00:31:23.000 --> 00:31:25.999
You can grab it after we're done.

00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:27.999
Ja, PLLI think it's adorable.

00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:29.999
Should I do it to the camera, too?

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:33.999
Hmm. PLLI,

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:36.999
I'm putting you under arrest!

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:40.999
[Performs the dance for the camera]

00:31:41.000 --> 00:31:42.999
[Dance continues]

00:31:43.000 --> 00:31:51.999
[Dance continues]

00:31:52.000 --> 00:31:54.999
[Dance continues]

00:31:55.000 --> 00:31:57.999
[Repeats the arrest chant]

00:31:58.000 --> 00:32:00.999
[Arrest chant continues]

00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:05.999
[Arrest chant continues]

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:09.999
Bang!

00:32:10.000 --> 00:32:13.999
One more time!

00:32:14.000 --> 00:32:17.999
[Repeats the cute chant]

00:32:18.000 --> 00:32:21.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:24.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:25.000 --> 00:32:26.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:27.000 --> 00:32:31.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:32.000 --> 00:32:33.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:38.999
[Cute chant continues]

00:32:39.000 --> 00:32:42.999
How'd you like my attack, PLLI?

00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:44.999
Even PLLI

00:32:45.000 --> 00:32:47.999
are just...

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:49.999
taking hit after hit!

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:52.999
What am I even saying? Ja, then...

00:32:53.000 --> 00:32:55.999
Hah!

00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:58.999
The final move. For the last one,

00:32:59.000 --> 00:33:00.999
let's see

00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:02.999
the outfit.

00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:04.999
Show us. Should we read a little more?

00:33:05.000 --> 00:33:08.999
Ja, the last one...

00:33:09.000 --> 00:33:12.999
Takes your breath away.

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:17.999
When you see me, when you see me...

00:33:18.000 --> 00:33:20.999
Spider.

00:33:21.000 --> 00:33:28.999
Switch my outfit, please.

00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:30.999
On the world tour, I soaked up

00:33:31.000 --> 00:33:34.999
all PLLI's love. I'm brimming with energy.

00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:37.999
So it might take your breath away.

00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:41.999
Breathless,

00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:45.999
just looking at me.

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:53.999
Don't get scared already.

00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:56.999
Ja.

00:33:57.000 --> 00:34:01.999
Ja,

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:06.999
shall we fight? Ready?

00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:10.999
Let's get straight to it.

00:34:11.000 --> 00:34:13.999
Show me your special move.

00:34:14.000 --> 00:34:36.999
Go on, hit me with it.

00:34:37.000 --> 00:34:37.999
[Game announcer] Round!

00:34:38.000 --> 00:35:06.999
Ready!

00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:22.999
Hey!

00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:24.999
Just as I thought.

00:35:25.000 --> 00:35:26.999
Caligo's no match for me.

00:35:27.000 --> 00:35:31.999
PLLI, still think Caligo's the cool one?

00:35:32.000 --> 00:35:32.999
Even now...

00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:35.999
Am I not oppa material?

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:39.999
I'll leave that up to PLLI. You can stand
up.

00:35:40.000 --> 00:35:41.999
Now that we're done,

00:35:42.000 --> 00:35:46.999
PLLI can decide.

00:35:47.000 --> 00:35:48.999
It was a great match, Caligo.

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:53.999
That sword of yours...

00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:55.999
What kind of sword is it?

00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:57.999
Doesn't look like that one, though.

00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:00.999
We'll save that for later. Do you

00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:02.999
have the will to fight me again?

00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:04.999
That sounds good.

00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:05.999
No, say you want to fight.

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:07.999
Oh, yes. I do.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:10.999
Then I'm curious about

00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:13.999
that last mystery outfit.

00:36:14.000 --> 00:36:15.999
The one with the question mark.

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:21.999
Show us!

00:36:22.000 --> 00:36:31.999
Let's go straight to it.

00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:33.999
Hah.

00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:36.999
Wait. My body's acting weird again.

00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:39.999
My face isn't showing.

00:36:40.000 --> 00:36:42.999
I really meant something's wrong.

00:36:43.000 --> 00:36:48.999
My body's glitching. Caligo, you're done
for.

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:50.999
Just give me a moment

00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:55.999
and I'll be ready to face you.

00:36:56.000 --> 00:37:05.999
My body's acting up again.

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:07.999
Is this our first ever guest

00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:10.999
on the stream?

00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:11.999
Um...

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:13.999
You've been doing great.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:15.999
Could you show us

00:37:16.000 --> 00:37:19.999
one more cool kick?

00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:23.999
Just one cool move.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:25.999
Oh! Oh!

00:37:26.000 --> 00:37:27.999
It's fine, it's fine, it's fine.

00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:29.999
You're fine. Look.

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:31.999
See? It's okay. Oh!

00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:37.999
That was cool. Ja, let's

00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:44.999
move on.

00:37:45.000 --> 00:37:47.999
Just wait a moment.

00:37:48.000 --> 00:37:48.999
I don't have much time left

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:50.999
to give PLLI

00:37:51.000 --> 00:37:54.999
a good time.

00:37:55.000 --> 00:37:57.999
Wait there.

00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:00.999
Wait there.

00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:08.999
Wait there.

00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:13.999
Something's wrong with my body.

00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:16.999
It's...

00:38:17.000 --> 00:39:00.999
My body's acting weird.

00:39:01.000 --> 00:39:20.999
[Raising Hamin]

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:23.999
Apparently not.

00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:29.999
Hold on.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:32.999
Looks like Hamin fell into

00:39:33.000 --> 00:39:36.999
a strange game world.

00:39:37.000 --> 00:39:38.999
To send him back to Asterum,

00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:40.999
all of Hamin's meters

00:39:41.000 --> 00:39:43.999
need to reach 100%.

00:39:44.000 --> 00:39:45.999
PLLI, let's work together

00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:53.999
to raise Hamin!

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:57.999
PLLI, where am I? Is this

00:39:58.000 --> 00:39:59.999
the PLLI Room?

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.999
Hang on.

00:40:02.000 --> 00:40:03.999
What are those meters up there?

00:40:04.000 --> 00:40:06.999
From what I saw, they all have to fill up

00:40:07.000 --> 00:40:09.999
before I can go back to Asterum.

00:40:10.000 --> 00:40:12.999
Can I actually do this?

00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:16.999
I'll only get back

00:40:17.000 --> 00:40:20.999
if PLLI raise me well.

00:40:21.000 --> 00:40:24.999
PLLI, can you do it?

00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:28.999
Think you can raise Hamin?

00:40:29.000 --> 00:40:33.999
Good. That's what I like to hear.

00:40:34.000 --> 00:40:36.999
Before we play the game,

00:40:37.000 --> 00:40:38.999
let's chat for a bit.

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:45.999
Ja, have a sip of water.

00:40:46.000 --> 00:40:46.999
I prepared a lot for this.

00:40:47.000 --> 00:40:50.999
See?

00:40:51.000 --> 00:40:52.999
Ja, it's been a while since

00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:58.999
I've been in the PLLI Room.

00:40:59.000 --> 00:40:59.999
I've got these cute bear ears

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.999
on today, too.

00:41:04.000 --> 00:41:06.999
Lovely to see you. Ja, aren't you

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:08.999
curious about the next game?

00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:11.999
I'm really curious, too.

00:41:12.000 --> 00:41:13.999
“Mom believes in you,” someone says.

00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:16.999
Mom, was that you in the chat?

00:41:17.000 --> 00:41:17.999
Nice. Ja, someone wants me

00:41:18.000 --> 00:41:20.999
to thank Caligo for his hard work.

00:41:21.000 --> 00:41:22.999
Maybe I should slip him

00:41:23.000 --> 00:41:25.999
a little something for his trouble

00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:27.999
before he heads home.

00:41:28.000 --> 00:41:29.999
“Can't you just live

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:30.999
in the PLLI Room?”

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.999
That's an option.

00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:34.999
I wouldn't have to go back to Asterum.

00:41:35.000 --> 00:41:37.999
But then I couldn't perform onstage.

00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:40.999
Is that okay? Can I just stay here

00:41:41.000 --> 00:41:43.999
in the PLLI Room all the time?

00:41:44.000 --> 00:41:46.999
In that case, I won't go. Hmm.

00:41:47.000 --> 00:41:49.999
“Let's just live together,” someone says.

00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:52.999
And you say the sock boots suit me.

00:41:53.000 --> 00:41:53.999
Thank you!

00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:57.999
Ja, I'm really curious about the next
game.

00:41:58.000 --> 00:42:00.999
I hope it's something PLLI

00:42:01.000 --> 00:42:03.999
will enjoy, too.

00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:07.999
I've packed a lot into today's stream,

00:42:08.000 --> 00:42:10.999
a little bit of everything.

00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:12.999
PLLI, are you

00:42:13.000 --> 00:42:13.999
having dinner right now?

00:42:14.000 --> 00:42:15.999
It's almost nine.

00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:18.999
Some of you are probably

00:42:19.000 --> 00:42:21.999
eating while you watch.

00:42:22.000 --> 00:42:24.999
I'd love it if you'd have something good

00:42:25.000 --> 00:42:28.999
to eat and celebrate

00:42:29.000 --> 00:42:30.999
my birthday with me.

00:42:31.000 --> 00:42:32.999
Oh, someone's had samgyeopsal.

00:42:33.000 --> 00:42:34.999
Now I really

00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:37.999
want some samgyeopsal. Ah, I...

00:42:38.000 --> 00:42:39.999
I just had a wisdom tooth out, and

00:42:40.000 --> 00:42:41.999
food might get stuck in the hole,

00:42:42.000 --> 00:42:43.999
so I can't really chew

