00:54:22.000 --> 00:54:22.999
so I called.

00:54:23.000 --> 00:54:25.999
Wow, you're such a T.

00:54:26.000 --> 00:54:27.999
I'm a T?

00:54:28.000 --> 00:54:30.999
Right. Anyway, Bonggu...

00:54:31.000 --> 00:54:32.999
Yes, Hamin?

00:54:33.000 --> 00:54:38.999
We should get together sometime.

00:54:39.000 --> 00:54:39.999
Out of nowhere?

00:54:40.000 --> 00:54:41.999
Yeah. If I come over,

00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:43.999
what'll you do for me?

00:54:44.000 --> 00:54:45.999
If you come over?

00:54:46.000 --> 00:54:49.999
Well, I won't abandon you, Hamin.

00:54:50.000 --> 00:54:51.999
I won't abandon you either.

00:54:52.000 --> 00:54:52.999
Right. — So...

00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:54.999
We feel the same way, then.

00:54:55.000 --> 00:54:56.999
Yeah, we do.

00:54:57.000 --> 00:54:58.999
But we'd have to do something,

00:54:59.000 --> 00:55:02.999
like get good food, right?

00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:04.999
Of course we'd get good food.

00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:13.999
Ja, how should we go about that?

00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:16.999
Ja, got it, Bamby.

00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:17.999
Yeah, yeah.

00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:19.999
There's a little mission

00:55:20.000 --> 00:55:21.999
