00:57:37.000 --> 00:57:39.999
I haven't checked today's horoscope.

00:57:40.000 --> 00:57:41.999
You're not reading this off something, are
you?

00:57:42.000 --> 00:57:43.999
No. I'm just good at talking, aren't I?

00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:44.999
Oh, very.

00:57:45.000 --> 00:57:46.999
No, I'm always like this.

00:57:47.000 --> 00:57:48.999
Whatever. I decided to show my true self.

00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:49.999
— Okay.

00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:53.999
Anyway, PLLI, it's not

00:57:54.000 --> 00:57:56.999
Hamin's birthday today, but let's
celebrate

00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:59.999
like it is.

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:03.999
Love you all. Love you too, Hamin.

00:58:04.000 --> 00:58:05.999
Thank you. I...

00:58:06.000 --> 00:58:08.999
— Yeah? — I love you too, Bamby.

00:58:09.000 --> 00:58:10.999
— Yes? — You've got a lovely voice.

00:58:11.000 --> 00:58:13.999
Oh, thank you.

00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:14.999
Yeah.

00:58:15.000 --> 00:58:15.999
Thank you.

00:58:16.000 --> 00:58:17.999
Well, I hope you

00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:18.999
have a good time.

00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:19.999
Will do.

00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:21.999
Thanks. Bye.

00:58:22.000 --> 00:58:22.999
Bye, bye!

00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:26.999
Bye!

00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:27.999
Ja, after Yejun-hyung,

00:58:28.000 --> 00:58:29.999
we got Bamby-hyung on the phone.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:34.999
Both of them ended up

00:58:35.000 --> 00:58:38.999
maxing out their affection meters.

00:58:39.000 --> 00:58:40.999
I got them to say what I wanted, one way
or another.

00:58:41.000 --> 00:58:43.999
But I still want to thank

00:58:44.000 --> 00:58:45.999
both hyungs for saying it.

00:58:46.000 --> 00:58:48.999
Why did I want to hear it

00:58:49.000 --> 00:58:51.999
