00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:53.999
I usually hear the things

00:58:54.000 --> 00:58:55.999
I want to hear anyway.

00:58:56.000 --> 00:58:58.999
When I was thinking about what I'd want

00:58:59.000 --> 00:59:01.999
to hear on stream,

00:59:02.000 --> 00:59:04.999
I just wanted something simple,

00:59:05.000 --> 00:59:06.999
heartfelt and full of affection.

00:59:07.000 --> 00:59:08.999
That's all.

00:59:09.000 --> 00:59:10.999
And it's not like Bamby

00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:12.999
doesn't usually buy me food.

00:59:13.000 --> 00:59:14.999
He buys me plenty

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:16.999
