00:59:17.000 --> 00:59:19.999
It's just always the most fun

00:59:20.000 --> 00:59:22.999
when I get Bamby to treat me.
Yejun-hyung...

00:59:23.000 --> 00:59:24.999
If I offer to pay, he always

00:59:25.000 --> 00:59:27.999
says no. Bamby-hyung is more like,

00:59:28.000 --> 00:59:30.999
“Oh, I'm treating you? Sure.”

00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:32.999
So there's this little thrill

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:34.999
when I catch him at the right moment.

00:59:35.000 --> 00:59:36.999
What would I want Bamby-hyung

00:59:37.000 --> 00:59:39.999
to buy me? Well,

00:59:40.000 --> 00:59:41.999
it's not so much a specific dish.

00:59:42.000 --> 00:59:44.999
I just want something

00:59:45.000 --> 00:59:47.999
a bit more expensive.

00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:50.999
The look on Bamby-hyung's face

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:51.999
is priceless.

00:59:52.000 --> 00:59:55.999
He acts unfazed. It's so cute.

00:59:56.000 --> 00:59:59.999
But that's how we are in PLAVE:

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.999
