02:07:59.000 --> 02:08:01.999
and dance. So handsome. Stay healthy.”

02:08:02.000 --> 02:08:03.999
“You're so smart.”

02:08:04.000 --> 02:08:05.999
“Be happy for a long, long time.”

02:08:06.000 --> 02:08:07.999
“Hamin's the coolest. Great at dancing

02:08:08.000 --> 02:08:10.999
and great at singing.”

02:08:11.000 --> 02:08:13.999
Thanks to PLLI,

02:08:14.000 --> 02:08:18.999
the happiness meter is maxed out!

02:08:19.000 --> 02:08:22.999
Love you!

02:08:23.000 --> 02:08:23.999
At last,

02:08:24.000 --> 02:08:26.999
I can

02:08:27.000 --> 02:08:31.999
set off for Asterum.

02:08:32.000 --> 02:08:33.999
Asterum!

02:08:34.000 --> 02:08:37.999
See you in Asterum.

02:08:38.000 --> 02:09:15.999
Wait, no.

02:09:16.000 --> 02:09:18.999
Thanks to all of you, PLLI,

02:09:19.000 --> 02:09:21.999
I'm back in Asterum.

02:09:22.000 --> 02:09:23.999
Thank you again. And

02:09:24.000 --> 02:09:26.999
it's not just this game. I always feel

02:09:27.000 --> 02:09:29.999
like PLLI are helping Hamin grow...

02:09:30.000 --> 02:09:31.999
I really feel it. You're always

02:09:32.000 --> 02:09:34.999
praising me, giving me hugs,

02:09:35.000 --> 02:09:36.999
encouraging me and cheering me on. I see
it all.

02:09:37.000 --> 02:09:40.999
So now it's my turn

02:09:41.000 --> 02:09:42.999
to help PLLI grow.

02:09:43.000 --> 02:09:44.999
Ja, anyway, now that

02:09:45.000 --> 02:09:47.999
we're back in Asterum, shall we

02:09:48.000 --> 02:09:52.999
take a photo? Ja,

02:09:53.000 --> 02:09:56.999
let's do a screenshot break.

02:09:57.000 --> 02:09:59.999
Ja.

02:10:00.000 --> 02:10:01.999
Ja, what pose should we do?

02:10:02.000 --> 02:10:09.999
Hmm.

02:10:10.000 --> 02:10:16.999
Oh, what? You haven't left yet?

02:10:17.000 --> 02:10:19.999
How long have you been here?

02:10:20.000 --> 02:10:21.999
Were you waiting

02:10:22.000 --> 02:10:23.999
since that action scene?

02:10:24.000 --> 02:10:25.999
I didn't get to say it earlier.

02:10:26.000 --> 02:10:27.999
I didn't get to wish you a happy birthday.

02:10:28.000 --> 02:10:28.999
Ah...

02:10:29.000 --> 02:10:29.999
Happy birthday!

02:10:30.000 --> 02:10:31.999
Aw, thank you. Come over

02:10:32.000 --> 02:10:33.999
and take a photo with me.

02:10:34.000 --> 02:10:36.999
Sure. I'll make sure you get

02:10:37.000 --> 02:10:37.999
a little something after this.

02:10:38.000 --> 02:10:39.999
Thank you.

02:10:40.000 --> 02:10:40.999
But you're not as tall

02:10:41.000 --> 02:10:43.999
as I expected.

02:10:44.000 --> 02:10:45.999
You're tall, though.

02:10:46.000 --> 02:10:48.999
It's my first time seeing you this close.

02:10:49.000 --> 02:10:50.999
Let's take a photo.

02:10:51.000 --> 02:10:51.999
Ja, should we do

02:10:52.000 --> 02:10:54.999
a heart or something?

02:10:55.000 --> 02:10:59.999
Ja, one, two, three.

02:11:00.000 --> 02:11:02.999
Ja, is there any pose

02:11:03.000 --> 02:11:04.999
you'd like to do?

02:11:05.000 --> 02:11:05.999
Oh, like this? This one's

02:11:06.000 --> 02:11:07.999
good.

02:11:08.000 --> 02:11:08.999
One, two...

02:11:09.000 --> 02:11:11.999
Love you!

02:11:12.000 --> 02:11:14.999
Thanks. If you need

02:11:15.000 --> 02:11:17.999
anything else...

02:11:18.000 --> 02:11:20.999
Nope.

02:11:21.000 --> 02:11:23.999
I mean, if there's nothing, just say so.

02:11:24.000 --> 02:11:24.999
If that's all, then...

02:11:25.000 --> 02:11:27.999
— Right. — Right.

02:11:28.000 --> 02:11:31.999
Then would you say goodbye

02:11:32.000 --> 02:11:35.999
to PLLI before you clock out?

02:11:36.000 --> 02:11:38.999
Thank you for making me feel so welcome

02:11:39.000 --> 02:11:40.999
at Hamin's birthday stream.

02:11:41.000 --> 02:11:43.999
I'll keep cheering

02:11:44.000 --> 02:11:46.999
for PLAVE and Hamin.

02:11:47.000 --> 02:11:47.999
— Fighting!

02:11:48.000 --> 02:11:49.999
— Fighting!

02:11:50.000 --> 02:11:52.999
Get home safely.

02:11:53.000 --> 02:11:55.999
The exit's on your left.

02:11:56.000 --> 02:11:56.999
Not there. Left, left, left.

02:11:57.000 --> 02:11:58.999
Right.

02:11:59.000 --> 02:12:02.999
Ja, so you hadn't left after all. Ja,

02:12:03.000 --> 02:12:05.999
let's take the photo.

02:12:06.000 --> 02:12:11.999
One, two, three.

02:12:12.000 --> 02:12:12.999
Sword spin.

02:12:13.000 --> 02:12:19.999
Love you!

02:12:20.000 --> 02:12:28.999
[Brief indistinct remark]

02:12:29.000 --> 02:12:46.999
With a “Love you,”

02:12:47.000 --> 02:12:49.999
that's one for the album.

02:12:50.000 --> 02:12:51.999
It's amazing how a photo

02:12:52.000 --> 02:12:54.999
turns into a memory after you take it.

02:12:55.000 --> 02:12:56.999
Actually, we're always making memories.

02:12:57.000 --> 02:13:00.999
Let's just enjoy this moment together.

02:13:01.000 --> 02:13:02.999
Ja, anyway,

02:13:03.000 --> 02:13:05.999
that's it for our screenshot break.

02:13:06.000 --> 02:13:08.999
My birthday's already passed,

02:13:09.000 --> 02:13:10.999
but today you all came together

02:13:11.000 --> 02:13:13.999
to make it feel like my birthday again.

02:13:14.000 --> 02:13:15.999
Thank you for celebrating with me

02:13:16.000 --> 02:13:17.999
and showing me so much love.

02:13:18.000 --> 02:13:20.999
To everyone who worked on today's stream:

02:13:21.000 --> 02:13:22.999
Caligo, our members and the producer,

02:13:23.000 --> 02:13:25.999
thank you for all the hard work.

02:13:26.000 --> 02:13:29.999
I want next year's stream to be even more
fun,

02:13:30.000 --> 02:13:33.999
so I'll start planning it now.

02:13:34.000 --> 02:13:36.999
I hope you'll look forward to

02:13:37.000 --> 02:13:38.999
what I come up with.

02:13:39.000 --> 02:13:41.999
Ja, I've prepared a From PLAVE

02:13:42.000 --> 02:13:43.999
for PLLI.

02:13:44.000 --> 02:13:46.999
There was something

02:13:47.000 --> 02:13:48.999
I wanted to sing.

02:13:49.000 --> 02:13:50.999
So I prepared a song for you.

02:13:51.000 --> 02:13:54.999
I hope you enjoy it.

02:13:55.000 --> 02:13:58.999
And with this, today's stream...

