02:16:38.000 --> 02:16:38.999
I tried a few ideas.

02:16:39.000 --> 02:16:41.999
Then the timing worked out.

02:16:42.000 --> 02:16:44.999
With my birthday coming up,

02:16:45.000 --> 02:16:47.999
I told Bamby-hyung, “Hyung,

02:16:48.000 --> 02:16:49.999
